WEBVTT

00:00.800 --> 00:02.970
(Adventurer's Guild Headquarters)

00:06.020 --> 00:08.060
How rude of you

00:08.230 --> 00:10.100
to make a lady wait.

00:14.860 --> 00:18.150
Oh my, have you aged again?

00:21.910 --> 00:25.240
What brings you here
at this hour, Jessica?

00:25.330 --> 00:27.790
I'm here for work, of course.

00:28.080 --> 00:29.660
I've got something...

00:30.330 --> 00:33.210
truly amazing.

00:38.340 --> 00:39.550
A book?

00:39.970 --> 00:41.880
No, this is...

00:42.720 --> 00:44.140
A secret quest?

00:44.220 --> 00:47.810
Come on! You're overreacting.

00:48.520 --> 00:51.560
I didn't think it would be
so easy to find it.

00:51.890 --> 00:54.230
Recently, the Information Guild

00:54.310 --> 00:57.230
has gained a lot of talented kids.
They've been a big help.

00:57.320 --> 00:58.360
Hold on.

00:58.440 --> 01:00.070
Where did you get this?

01:01.200 --> 01:05.910
Did you forget that information merchants
are bound by confidentiality?

01:11.000 --> 01:16.750
So not all secret quests
are sealed in relics?

01:18.380 --> 01:19.800
That Jessica

01:19.880 --> 01:22.380
really brought something incredible.

01:22.470 --> 01:23.720
What should we do

01:23.800 --> 01:25.430
with the book over there?

01:25.930 --> 01:28.850
Keep it in the underground library
on the deepest floor

01:28.930 --> 01:30.890
of the Guild underground labyrinth.

01:30.980 --> 01:32.560
Understood.

01:39.730 --> 01:41.360
15 years.

01:42.150 --> 01:45.320
Has it been that long already?

01:46.660 --> 01:50.290
(On the Day of the Centennial Festival)

02:04.260 --> 02:05.430
Hurry!

02:05.510 --> 02:07.180
Let's hurry, Jade!

02:07.800 --> 02:09.050
I-I'm...

02:09.140 --> 02:10.720
What?

02:11.600 --> 02:14.770
Just seeing Ms. Alina smile like that

02:15.270 --> 02:17.810
is enough for me to die with no regrets.

02:17.900 --> 02:18.860
What?

02:18.940 --> 02:20.230
That's right.

02:20.320 --> 02:21.320
Ms. Alina

02:22.070 --> 02:24.950
is actually such an innocent girl.

02:26.240 --> 02:27.410
All that overtime work

02:27.490 --> 02:28.620
and the constant daily grind

02:28.700 --> 02:30.530
have changed you a little.

02:31.410 --> 02:34.000
Your real self is actually this cute.

02:34.250 --> 02:37.000
Shut... shut up!

02:37.080 --> 02:38.540
Cut the crap!

02:38.630 --> 02:39.960
We're going

02:40.040 --> 02:43.050
to conquer this whole festival
from the inside out!

03:02.610 --> 03:07.950
(I May Be a Guild Receptionist,
but I'll Solo Any Boss to Clock Out on Time)

04:17.100 --> 04:20.390
(Adventurers Guild, Underground Prison)

04:20.480 --> 04:24.360
(Underground Level 1)

04:27.190 --> 04:28.690
Murderer.

04:28.780 --> 04:30.780
Why didn't you treat them?

04:30.860 --> 04:33.700
Murderer...

04:35.160 --> 04:36.740
Murderer...

04:37.790 --> 04:40.830
Hey, I think you shouldn't go.

04:40.910 --> 04:44.590
Today's the fun and exciting
Centennial Festival.

04:45.670 --> 04:48.510
I didn't ask you to come.

04:48.920 --> 04:51.590
You can go to the festival by yourself.

04:51.680 --> 04:53.680
Once I heard you're going to see Aiden,

04:53.760 --> 04:56.680
of course I'd be concerned, right?

04:56.970 --> 04:57.850
By the way,

04:57.930 --> 04:59.980
what are you going to say
when you see him?

05:04.610 --> 05:10.440
That kind of person who believes the party
was wiped out because of a healer.

05:10.940 --> 05:14.530
I don't think you can have
a normal conversation with him.

05:15.990 --> 05:17.410
I know.

05:17.790 --> 05:18.830
But

05:18.910 --> 05:22.670
If I had a better read
of the situation back then,

05:22.750 --> 05:25.290
or if my Sigurth skill had manifested,

05:25.540 --> 05:27.920
maybe no one would have died.

05:32.130 --> 05:33.970
Say, Lululi.

05:34.510 --> 05:36.600
No matter what your past is,

05:36.680 --> 05:38.680
we're your party members now.

05:39.220 --> 05:41.640
We don't think of you as a useless healer.

05:41.730 --> 05:45.230
And we certainly don't think of you
as a murderer.

05:48.270 --> 05:50.150
Don't forget that.

05:53.990 --> 05:56.200
Both Lowe and Jade

05:56.280 --> 05:58.160
are very kind.

06:01.790 --> 06:05.210
I... I'm Lululi Ashford.

06:05.290 --> 06:09.290
I... I'll be in your care from now on.

06:09.590 --> 06:12.300
Silver Sword might have
a lot of tough encounters,

06:12.380 --> 06:15.090
but I'll definitely protect my companions.

06:15.800 --> 06:17.260
Leave it to me.

06:19.680 --> 06:22.980
They're always so kind and warm.

06:23.680 --> 06:25.890
If I continue to team up with them,

06:25.980 --> 06:27.860
I might lose them both

06:27.940 --> 06:30.610
because of my incompetence.

06:31.190 --> 06:32.190
That's why...

06:34.530 --> 06:37.700
this is as far as I can go.

06:40.080 --> 06:41.620
Thank you all so much

06:41.700 --> 06:43.660
for everything up until now.

06:48.210 --> 06:49.380
Jade!

06:49.460 --> 06:51.550
Hurry up and get over here!

06:51.630 --> 06:53.420
All right, all right.

06:58.970 --> 07:02.510
So this is the highest-grade Rosagne beef!

07:02.600 --> 07:04.890
It's so tender, it melts in my mouth.

07:05.850 --> 07:08.350
This is heaven, isn't it?

07:09.900 --> 07:10.980
Everyone

07:11.070 --> 07:13.780
is enjoying this year's
Centennial Festival.

07:15.030 --> 07:16.030
And just like them,

07:16.110 --> 07:19.030
I'm also enjoying
this year's Centennial Festival.

07:20.240 --> 07:21.240
I earned this.

07:21.660 --> 07:22.950
I successfully reclaimed

07:23.040 --> 07:26.870
my freedom and dignity as a worker!

07:27.000 --> 07:29.080
Today, I'm going to forget
about working overtime

07:29.170 --> 07:32.340
and enjoy myself to the fullest!

07:34.090 --> 07:35.760
By the way, Ms. Alina,

07:35.840 --> 07:38.050
you sure eat a lot.

07:38.130 --> 07:40.050
But you're so skinny.

07:40.140 --> 07:42.640
Where did everything you eat go to?

07:43.970 --> 07:46.020
To relieve stress,

07:46.100 --> 07:47.520
I regularly binge eat,

07:47.600 --> 07:50.980
so my digestive system
has been strengthened.

07:51.400 --> 07:53.610
Then, you should be able
to eat a lot more.

07:53.690 --> 07:55.150
What should we eat next?

07:55.990 --> 07:57.240
Let's see.

07:57.320 --> 08:00.700
We've already had the main dish.

08:00.780 --> 08:02.410
Let's have dessert next.

08:02.660 --> 08:03.660
Over at the main square,

08:03.740 --> 08:07.660
I heard they're selling an interesting
dessert made of candied fruit.

08:07.750 --> 08:09.080
I see.

08:09.160 --> 08:12.580
The main event of the first day
is about to start, so it's perfect timing.

08:13.340 --> 08:15.130
Let's go, Ms. Alina.

08:19.930 --> 08:21.970
The square is crowded.

08:22.050 --> 08:23.720
Let's hold hands
so we don't get separated.

08:23.800 --> 08:25.720
It doesn't matter if we get separated.

08:26.100 --> 08:28.100
Actually, I've been wanting to do this!

08:28.180 --> 08:30.140
But Ms. Alina is always carrying food.

08:30.230 --> 08:32.350
Your hands have no free time at all.

08:32.730 --> 08:34.770
I won't miss this chance!

08:35.190 --> 08:37.480
I just want to eat while walking.

08:37.570 --> 08:39.450
Who wants to hold hands with you?

08:39.530 --> 08:41.820
I've worked so hard to earn
this Centennial Festival...

08:42.530 --> 08:43.700
Leave it to me.

08:43.780 --> 08:46.120
Let's eliminate overtime
and go to the Centennial Festival,

08:47.040 --> 08:48.040
Ms. Alina!

08:50.290 --> 08:52.120
What's wrong, Ms. Alina?

08:52.210 --> 08:54.840
It's... it's nothing.

08:58.300 --> 09:00.420
Do you have a stomachache?

09:00.510 --> 09:02.340
Wait here, I'll grab some medicine.

09:06.010 --> 09:07.010
What?

09:10.520 --> 09:13.020
It's because of that.

09:13.100 --> 09:15.520
If it weren't for your help,

09:15.610 --> 09:16.820
I wouldn't...

09:17.320 --> 09:20.900
be able to attend
the Centennial Festival this year.

09:21.320 --> 09:22.780
So...

09:22.860 --> 09:25.240
Well, how should I put it?

09:29.660 --> 09:30.580
Thank you.

09:37.630 --> 09:41.260
(Underground Level 10)

09:44.180 --> 09:45.430
Aiden.

09:49.850 --> 09:53.390
Did you bring your current companion
to feel sorry for me?

09:55.810 --> 09:58.230
I'm...sorry.

09:59.110 --> 10:02.700
Do you think I wanted to use
such a shameless method from the start?

10:04.360 --> 10:05.950
After losing my party members,

10:06.030 --> 10:08.870
I wanted to become stronger
from the bottom of my heart.

10:09.370 --> 10:11.830
I believed that one day,
my skills would manifest.

10:11.910 --> 10:16.710
I had faith I could still
be a tank with one arm.

10:16.790 --> 10:18.040
But one day,

10:18.130 --> 10:19.710
I heard something.

10:21.510 --> 10:25.720
A healer named Lululi Ashford
had joined the Silver Sword.

10:27.140 --> 10:29.010
I can't believe the companion-killer

10:29.100 --> 10:30.720
manifested Sigurth skills

10:30.810 --> 10:33.480
and even claimed
to be an elite adventurer.

10:37.770 --> 10:40.400
That's when I suddenly felt
like I couldn't care less.

10:40.770 --> 10:43.740
I can't be picky about my methods!

10:44.030 --> 10:45.820
If I could get a Dia skill,

10:45.900 --> 10:47.990
I'd absolutely kill you first

10:48.070 --> 10:49.830
and avenge them!

10:51.830 --> 10:53.870
He won't listen.

10:54.330 --> 10:56.330
You're just adding fuel to the fire.

10:57.120 --> 10:58.460
Get lost!

11:01.050 --> 11:01.960
Scram!

11:02.050 --> 11:03.460
You murderer!

11:03.550 --> 11:06.630
Murderer! Murderer!

11:11.510 --> 11:13.890
How dare you look down on me?

11:14.600 --> 11:16.140
That murderer.

11:19.770 --> 11:20.770
No.

11:21.270 --> 11:23.110
The real murderer

11:23.190 --> 11:24.490
is me.

11:24.900 --> 11:27.360
Looks like you made quite a scene.

11:31.700 --> 11:33.160
What are you doing here?

11:34.200 --> 11:37.920
I had something to take care of
on the deepest floor,

11:38.000 --> 11:41.540
and I took the chance to pick up
my precious companion.

11:42.960 --> 11:44.840
In a moment, Ricaide

11:44.920 --> 11:47.840
will cause a ruckus at the festival.

11:48.760 --> 11:52.100
We'll take advantage of the commotion
and get out of here.

11:54.140 --> 11:55.850
Good idea.

11:55.930 --> 11:57.480
Come on, let's go.

11:58.310 --> 12:01.480
After being persecuted for so long,

12:02.060 --> 12:04.150
we're finally on the verge of victory.

12:08.700 --> 12:11.070
I never thought this day would come.

12:11.870 --> 12:14.990
I'm glad I persevered.

12:17.200 --> 12:19.000
We're just holding hands.

12:19.080 --> 12:20.580
What's there to be happy about?

12:21.210 --> 12:23.290
It's so inconvenient
to carry things with one hand.

12:32.510 --> 12:35.510
That's some amazing magic.

12:37.060 --> 12:38.060
What?

12:47.900 --> 12:49.780
(Beak of Frost)
Glassis.

12:49.780 --> 12:50.580
(Beak of Frost)

12:53.030 --> 12:54.030
What?

12:54.450 --> 12:56.410
That's an attack spell!
Everyone, run!

12:56.490 --> 12:57.490
(Rain of Ice)
Imber.

13:01.330 --> 13:03.210
My... my Centennial Festival.

13:05.290 --> 13:08.460
This stupid and ugly world.

13:08.920 --> 13:11.130
Watch as I crush everything

13:11.550 --> 13:13.550
and return it to nothingness.

13:15.510 --> 13:18.600
How dare you ruin my Centennial Festival.

13:19.100 --> 13:22.270
Unforgivable...

13:22.980 --> 13:24.360
Unforgivable!

13:24.650 --> 13:26.150
Skill Activate.

13:26.650 --> 13:29.110
That warhammer is... the Executioner?

13:29.190 --> 13:30.360
You

13:30.440 --> 13:33.240
stupid clown!

13:38.040 --> 13:39.660
Do you know

13:39.750 --> 13:41.960
what this Centennial Festival means to me?

13:43.290 --> 13:45.670
Wait, hear me out first!

13:45.750 --> 13:49.590
I've been looking forward to this day.

13:49.670 --> 13:51.380
I finally made it here

13:51.470 --> 13:54.010
by hustling through overtime every day.

13:54.090 --> 13:55.140
What?

13:55.510 --> 13:58.100
Don't think you can die easily.

13:58.180 --> 14:02.100
Count up your sins!

14:06.860 --> 14:08.320
Is it coming from the town?

14:12.030 --> 14:13.030
Lululi!

14:13.110 --> 14:15.110
Let's go home for today.

14:15.200 --> 14:16.990
We'll go to the festival tomorrow.

14:19.160 --> 14:20.160
Okay.

14:25.420 --> 14:26.420
Oh, no.

14:26.670 --> 14:30.130
I've been caught red-handed.

14:31.460 --> 14:34.430
Why... are you here?

14:38.850 --> 14:39.850
Aiden?

14:39.930 --> 14:41.060
Why are you...

14:41.140 --> 14:43.390
I was ordered to release him.

14:43.810 --> 14:45.140
How is that possible?

14:45.230 --> 14:46.940
The Guild would never give such an order.

14:47.020 --> 14:48.650
Compared to that,

14:48.730 --> 14:52.650
shouldn't you be more worried about this?

14:53.280 --> 14:54.570
What's that?

14:55.030 --> 14:58.990
I borrowed it
from the Guild underground library.

14:59.070 --> 15:01.080
It's a secret quest.

15:01.160 --> 15:02.040
What?

15:04.710 --> 15:06.620
No! Don't open it!

15:10.130 --> 15:14.720
The location is Forest of Eternity,
Mossy Rock Lake.

15:14.800 --> 15:18.550
The achievement condition
is defeating all the floor bosses.

15:18.640 --> 15:23.470
Confirm acceptance of this quest
based on the above-mentioned conditions.

15:28.150 --> 15:29.560
Now then,

15:29.650 --> 15:33.110
since I purposely accepted
the quest in front of you two,

15:33.190 --> 15:36.700
the Silver Sword
will definitely come too, right?

15:36.780 --> 15:38.160
What do you mean?

15:38.570 --> 15:41.410
I'm inviting you, of course,

15:41.490 --> 15:44.540
to go see the Dark God together.

15:46.160 --> 15:47.620
Skill Activate.

15:47.710 --> 15:49.380
(Spatial Transcendence)
Sigurth Mover!

15:49.460 --> 15:50.290
Wait!

15:50.380 --> 15:52.210
If you revive the Dark God...

15:52.750 --> 15:53.750
Tsk.

15:55.920 --> 15:58.180
The festival is canceled.

15:58.260 --> 16:00.390
The first day, the second day,

16:00.760 --> 16:03.180
and the third day's
Souls Rest Ceremony are all gone.

16:03.260 --> 16:04.350
Ms. Alina.

16:04.430 --> 16:07.270
It seems the festival will resume soon.

16:07.350 --> 16:08.440
Really?

16:08.520 --> 16:09.350
Yes.

16:09.440 --> 16:10.980
After all, no residents were injured

16:11.060 --> 16:12.730
and the culprit was caught.

16:12.820 --> 16:16.650
That's... that's great!

16:16.740 --> 16:19.740
We have to thank
this thick-skinned adventurers' capital!

16:19.820 --> 16:20.950
Leader!

16:22.030 --> 16:23.160
What happened?

16:25.450 --> 16:27.620
Someone took on a secret quest?

16:27.710 --> 16:28.830
It's Heitz.

16:28.910 --> 16:30.370
He infiltrated the Guild
underground library

16:30.460 --> 16:32.080
and stole the secret quest.

16:32.170 --> 16:33.210
What?

16:33.290 --> 16:35.460
He's planning to revive the Dark God!

16:35.550 --> 16:37.090
I'm going to gear up first.

16:37.170 --> 16:38.720
Tell me the details later.

16:39.220 --> 16:40.380
Jade?

16:41.180 --> 16:42.890
Ms. Alina, don't worry.

16:43.180 --> 16:45.180
But...

16:45.260 --> 16:46.850
Just us going is fine.

16:47.350 --> 16:48.980
Haven't you been working hard

16:49.060 --> 16:50.850
for the Centennial Festival?

16:52.440 --> 16:53.940
We're back in action!

16:54.020 --> 16:55.320
Yay!

16:59.860 --> 17:02.030
We have to stop them
from reviving the Dark God.

17:09.200 --> 17:10.620
I'm going too.

17:11.500 --> 17:12.750
Ms. Alina.

17:12.830 --> 17:16.420
I... don't want you guys to die.

17:17.920 --> 17:19.010
Thank you.

17:19.800 --> 17:21.880
I'm sorry, Ms. Alina.

17:24.010 --> 17:27.010
(Forest of Eternity)

17:27.810 --> 17:29.890
(Mossy Rock Lake)
There's an entrance in a place like this?

17:29.980 --> 17:32.140
(Mossy Rock Lake)
Perhaps this hidden floor

17:32.230 --> 17:35.770
is the true dungeon
of the Forest of Eternity.

17:37.110 --> 17:39.280
This is the boss' room, isn't it?

17:39.610 --> 17:40.570
Oh, no.

17:40.650 --> 17:42.950
They beat us to it.

17:43.030 --> 17:45.070
They even called the Executioner.

17:45.160 --> 17:46.870
That's quite the effort.

17:47.200 --> 17:49.160
Well, it's understandable.

17:49.240 --> 17:51.370
If the Dark God is revived,

17:51.460 --> 17:54.000
even Silver Sword won't be able to...

17:54.080 --> 17:55.080
(Rain of Ice)
Imber!

17:58.710 --> 18:00.970
I definitely won't let you
revive the Dark God.

18:01.510 --> 18:04.130
There's no way you'd kill us.

18:04.590 --> 18:06.180
After all, if a soul is offered here,

18:06.260 --> 18:09.100
the Dark God will be revived.

18:09.180 --> 18:11.100
You know a lot, don't you?

18:11.480 --> 18:14.270
That's why you're going
to turn into ice here!

18:15.520 --> 18:17.060
Skill Activate.

18:17.400 --> 18:19.400
(The Soul Offerer)
Sigurth Offer!

18:27.740 --> 18:29.240
This seems to be a skill

18:29.330 --> 18:33.290
that nullifies all damage to our side
in exchange for one's own life.

18:33.370 --> 18:35.920
I can't believe
such a crappy skill manifested.

18:36.000 --> 18:38.420
I feel sorry for you.

18:39.210 --> 18:41.960
Hey... that's not what you said.

18:42.340 --> 18:44.840
Didn't you say the Dark God
would grant us Dia skills?

18:44.930 --> 18:47.010
The reason we're here

18:47.090 --> 18:49.640
is to help the Master Dark God

18:49.720 --> 18:51.310
gain even greater power.

18:52.600 --> 18:55.140
Are you going to freeze us again?

18:56.100 --> 18:59.650
Aren't you afraid
that I have some trump cards left?

19:00.230 --> 19:02.570
Why do you want to revive
the Dark God so badly?

19:04.530 --> 19:06.030
Mr. Silver Sword,

19:06.110 --> 19:10.240
who benefits from skills and constantly
takes center stage, wouldn't understand.

19:11.040 --> 19:12.240
My skill

19:12.330 --> 19:14.120
is specialized for running away.

19:14.750 --> 19:16.960
It's useless in a battle.

19:17.370 --> 19:20.290
As time goes by,
I'm just seen as a burden.

19:23.170 --> 19:27.470
Why do skills even exist
in this world in the first place?

19:27.720 --> 19:29.390
They can only be bestowed unilaterally,

19:29.470 --> 19:30.970
leaving everything to fate.

19:31.060 --> 19:33.850
If you hit the jackpot,
you become a winner in life.

19:34.220 --> 19:35.350
If you don't,

19:35.430 --> 19:37.690
you'll have to rot away in a garbage dump.

19:38.060 --> 19:38.940
Until one day,

19:39.020 --> 19:40.690
a man in black appeared in front of me

19:40.770 --> 19:42.190
and told me this one thing.

19:42.570 --> 19:44.150
A man in black.

19:44.530 --> 19:48.990
He said he could destroy this
unreasonable world in an unreasonable way.

19:49.820 --> 19:50.950
To do that,

19:51.030 --> 19:53.870
we must revive the Master Dark God.

19:53.950 --> 19:55.540
I won't let anyone

19:55.620 --> 19:57.410
stand in Master's way
of destroying this world.

19:57.920 --> 19:59.210
That's why...

20:07.720 --> 20:10.300
Master... Dark God.

20:13.560 --> 20:14.640
Please...

20:15.020 --> 20:16.730
destroy...

20:17.180 --> 20:18.810
this world.

20:22.230 --> 20:25.110
What a creepy old man.

20:26.030 --> 20:27.110
Dark God.

20:27.650 --> 20:31.120
Viena, there are so many humans.

20:31.530 --> 20:34.790
Yes, there sure are a lot of humans.

20:34.870 --> 20:37.540
They are all our food,

20:37.620 --> 20:38.500
Fiena.

20:38.580 --> 20:40.120
There are two Dark Gods!

20:40.210 --> 20:41.460
Chant!

20:43.130 --> 20:44.590
(The Giant God's Arrow of Death)
Dia Morte!

20:44.590 --> 20:45.630
(The Giant God's Arrow of Death)

20:46.130 --> 20:48.050
Hurry up, Fiena, you should say it too.

20:48.380 --> 20:49.880
Fiena has to do it too?

20:49.970 --> 20:50.970
Yes.

20:51.390 --> 20:52.680
Chant.

20:54.220 --> 20:55.680
(The Giant God's Arrow of Death)
Dia Morte.

20:55.680 --> 20:56.720
(The Giant God's Arrow of Death)

20:57.020 --> 20:58.520
They're exactly the same.

20:58.600 --> 21:00.390
Can they share skills?

21:00.480 --> 21:01.810
Of course.

21:01.900 --> 21:05.150
After all, we are two as one.

21:05.230 --> 21:08.610
Well then, which sacrifice
should we consume first?

21:08.690 --> 21:09.570
Lululi!

21:09.650 --> 21:10.820
Skill Activate.

21:10.900 --> 21:12.740
(The Undying Blesser)
Sigurth Revive!

21:12.740 --> 21:13.650
(The Undying Blesser)

21:14.910 --> 21:16.620
There's a handsome guy?

21:16.870 --> 21:19.000
I found a handsome guy!

21:19.370 --> 21:21.580
This cutie's soul

21:21.670 --> 21:23.000
will be mine!

21:29.970 --> 21:32.470
It's too weak for a Dark God's power.

21:43.520 --> 21:45.360
It feels like I didn't land the hit.

21:45.810 --> 21:47.780
There's an opening!

21:55.280 --> 21:57.080
It feels like I didn't land the hit again.

22:07.290 --> 22:10.340
Do they both have regenerative abilities?

22:10.420 --> 22:11.970
Didn't I tell you?

22:12.050 --> 22:13.300
Viena and Fiena

22:13.380 --> 22:15.090
are two as one.

22:15.180 --> 22:17.640
Yes, we are two as one.

23:52.980 --> 23:53.820
Next episode.

23:53.900 --> 23:55.690
I may be a useless healer,

23:55.780 --> 23:59.160
but I'll try my best to do what I can.

23:59.160 --> 24:01.160
(Next Episode: I May Be a Useless Healer,
But I'll Try My Best to Do What I Can)
